  Notes: 'Multiplayer Freestyle(28). This mode''s own scene runs on the BARREN cell - its arena is nothing but the vessels, their trails and the crystals the mode''s controller places, none of which a solo satellite can stand up. The preview honestly shows the mode''s cell: open water, a nucleus, and the vessel to fly. Sparse by construction, not by omission.'
